From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: ppe: manage DSA and PPPoE flow lifecycle

Normalize service/customer tags and physical or QCA virtual-port
identities. Own QinQ roles, untagged fallback and lazily activated
PPPoE sessions in one lifecycle. Preserve verified rollback and
quarantine, validate normalized REPLACE requests against hardware
owners and keep aggregate failure counters.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
